  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAWEM is crucial to enable our energy transition. It fosters competitive pricing and investment, promotes innovation and modernisation, reduces reliance on the national fiscus, enhances energy security and enables a transparent and fair cost distribution.</narrative>
  </description>
