   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity and Remuneration
Mechanisms (CRM)</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Capacity Remuneration Mechanism (CRM) is a tool that can provide a market mechanism for the SAWEM to support capacity adequacy by providing the generators with the missing money.</narrative>
   </description>
