  <document-link format="APPLICATION/PDF" url="https://iatipublisher-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/document-link/537/Draft%20Eskom%20Market%20Power_290420251757925864.pdf">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eskom Market Power</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">At start of SAWEM, Eskom Generation will supply approximately 90% of the electricity in South Africa.
The SAWEM market design proposes the use of vesting contracts to address Eskom&#x2019;s market dominance during the transition to a liberalised market. We compare the proposed transition mechanisms for SAWEM against experiences in electricity markets that were liberalised in Singapore, Great Britain (GB), and Ireland to identify
any gaps in the current regulatory framework that needs to be addressed and propose solutions where relevant.</narrative>
   </description>
   <category code="A08"></category>
   <language code="EN"></language>
   <document-date iso-date="2025-04-29"></document-date>
  </document-link>
