   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Qualitative assessment of tariff structure</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Market Code defines a number of the settlement processes, primarily for the SMP and vesting contracts, SAWEM cost components inventory, South Africa&#x2019;s electricity tariff structure, A review of tariff structures in wholesale markets in other countries shows some nuances exist, Approaches to tariff allocation, Potential tariff allocation approaches for SAWEM costs and Key recommendations.</narrative>
